    <string name="help_title">HELP</string>
    <string name="help_section_calendar">Calendar</string>
    <string name="help_section_calendar_text">The calendar shows up to four schedules at once. Each day cell has a dot per schedule: colour = shift type, letter = first letter of the type name (when enabled). Tap a day for day details.\n\nSwipe left/right to change month. The month and year frames open quick navigation lists.</string>
    <string name="help_section_schedules">Schedules</string>
    <string name="help_section_schedules_text">In the Schedules menu: name, seed date and a repeating cycle "N days — shift type". Cycle rows are added and removed with the buttons on the right.</string>
    <string name="help_section_adhoc">Shift override</string>
    <string name="help_section_adhoc_text">In the Shift override menu: choose a schedule, a period of dates and the desired type — the type changes for those dates. A new override replaces any overlapping periods of the same schedule.</string>
    <string name="help_section_types">Shift types and colours</string>
    <string name="help_section_types_text">"Shift types" — the type name and its visibility on the calendar (hidden types are not shown). "Colours" — the dot colour for each "schedule × shift type" pair.</string>
    <string name="help_section_reminder">Shift alarm</string>
    <string name="help_section_reminder_text">Enable the "Shift alarm" in Settings and set your own time for each shift type. The app schedules alarms 62 days ahead and restores them after a phone reboot.</string>
